# ========================================================
# OPTIONAL PERSISTENCE CREDENTIALS FOR VERCEL
# ========================================================
# If you don't set any of these, the website works 100% out of the box
# using browser LocalStorage + offers a 1-click JSON backup & restore in /edit!
#
# To enable multi-device cloud persistence on your Vercel deployment:
# Choose either Option A (Upstash Redis REST - easiest) or Option B (Firebase Firestore).

# --------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION A: Upstash Redis REST API (Super easy & lightweight)
# 1. Create a free account at https://upstash.com
# 2. Create a free Redis database
# 3. Copy the REST URL and REST Token and paste them below:
# --------------------------------------------------------
VITE_UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://your-upstash-redis-url.upstash.io
VITE_UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=your-upstash-token-here

# --------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION B: Firebase Firestore (Alternative)
# 1. Create a project at https://console.firebase.google.com
# 2. Enable Cloud Firestore
# 3. Copy your Web App config credentials:
# --------------------------------------------------------
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
